Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: functions

    2 functions: function functions
    3          | ε

    4 function: FUNC IDENT LPAR RPAR LCUR statements RCUR

    5 statements: statement statements
    6           | ε

    7 statement: PRINT LPAR variable RPAR SEMICOLON
    8          | IDENT EQUAL variable PLUS variable SEMICOLON
    9          | IDENT EQUAL variable SEMICOLON
   10          | INT_KEYWORD IDENT SEMICOLON

   11 variable: IDENT
   12         | NUMBER


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    IDENT (258) 4 8 9 10 11
    NUMBER (259) 12
    FUNC (260) 4
    RPAR (261) 4 7
    LPAR (262) 4 7
    RCUR (263) 4
    LCUR (264) 4
    PRINT (265) 7
    SEMICOLON (266) 7 8 9 10
    INT_KEYWORD (267) 10
    EQUAL (268) 8 9
    PLUS (269) 8


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (15)
        on left: 0
    program (16)
        on left: 1
        on right: 0
    functions (17)
        on left: 2 3
        on right: 1 2
    function (18)
        on left: 4
        on right: 2
    statements (19)
        on left: 5 6
        on right: 4 5
    statement (20)
        on left: 7 8 9 10
        on right: 5
    variable (21)
        on left: 11 12
        on right: 7 8 9


State 0

    0 $accept: • program $end

    FUNC  shift, and go to state 1

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (functions)

    program    go to state 2
    functions  go to state 3
    function   go to state 4


State 1

    4 function: FUNC • IDENT LPAR RPAR LCUR statements RCUR

    IDENT  shift, and go to state 5


State 2

    0 $accept: program • $end

    $end  shift, and go to state 6


State 3

    1 program: functions •

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (program)


State 4

    2 functions: function • functions

    FUNC  shift, and go to state 1

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (functions)

    functions  go to state 7
    function   go to state 4


State 5

    4 function: FUNC IDENT • LPAR RPAR LCUR statements RCUR

    LPAR  shift, and go to state 8


State 6

    0 $accept: program $end •

    $default  accept


State 7

    2 functions: function functions •

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (functions)


State 8

    4 function: FUNC IDENT LPAR • RPAR LCUR statements RCUR

    RPAR  shift, and go to state 9


State 9

    4 function: FUNC IDENT LPAR RPAR • LCUR statements RCUR

    LCUR  shift, and go to state 10


State 10

    4 function: FUNC IDENT LPAR RPAR LCUR • statements RCUR

    IDENT        shift, and go to state 11
    PRINT        shift, and go to state 12
    INT_KEYWORD  shift, and go to state 13

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (statements)

    statements  go to state 14
    statement   go to state 15


State 11

    8 statement: IDENT • EQUAL variable PLUS variable SEMICOLON
    9          | IDENT • EQUAL variable SEMICOLON

    EQUAL  shift, and go to state 16


State 12

    7 statement: PRINT • LPAR variable RPAR SEMICOLON

    LPAR  shift, and go to state 17


State 13

   10 statement: INT_KEYWORD • IDENT SEMICOLON

    IDENT  shift, and go to state 18


State 14

    4 function: FUNC IDENT LPAR RPAR LCUR statements • RCUR

    RCUR  shift, and go to state 19


State 15

    5 statements: statement • statements

    IDENT        shift, and go to state 11
    PRINT        shift, and go to state 12
    INT_KEYWORD  shift, and go to state 13

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (statements)

    statements  go to state 20
    statement   go to state 15


State 16

    8 statement: IDENT EQUAL • variable PLUS variable SEMICOLON
    9          | IDENT EQUAL • variable SEMICOLON

    IDENT   shift, and go to state 21
    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 22

    variable  go to state 23


State 17

    7 statement: PRINT LPAR • variable RPAR SEMICOLON

    IDENT   shift, and go to state 21
    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 22

    variable  go to state 24


State 18

   10 statement: INT_KEYWORD IDENT • SEMICOLON

    SEMICOLON  shift, and go to state 25


State 19

    4 function: FUNC IDENT LPAR RPAR LCUR statements RCUR •

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (function)


State 20

    5 statements: statement statements •

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (statements)


State 21

   11 variable: IDENT •

    $default  reduce using rule 11 (variable)


State 22

   12 variable: NUMBER •

    $default  reduce using rule 12 (variable)


State 23

    8 statement: IDENT EQUAL variable • PLUS variable SEMICOLON
    9          | IDENT EQUAL variable • SEMICOLON

    SEMICOLON  shift, and go to state 26
    PLUS       shift, and go to state 27


State 24

    7 statement: PRINT LPAR variable • RPAR SEMICOLON

    RPAR  shift, and go to state 28


State 25

   10 statement: INT_KEYWORD IDENT SEMICOLON •

    $default  reduce using rule 10 (statement)


State 26

    9 statement: IDENT EQUAL variable SEMICOLON •

    $default  reduce using rule 9 (statement)


State 27

    8 statement: IDENT EQUAL variable PLUS • variable SEMICOLON

    IDENT   shift, and go to state 21
    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 22

    variable  go to state 29


State 28

    7 statement: PRINT LPAR variable RPAR • SEMICOLON

    SEMICOLON  shift, and go to state 30


State 29

    8 statement: IDENT EQUAL variable PLUS variable • SEMICOLON

    SEMICOLON  shift, and go to state 31


State 30

    7 statement: PRINT LPAR variable RPAR SEMICOLON •

    $default  reduce using rule 7 (statement)


State 31

    8 statement: IDENT EQUAL variable PLUS variable SEMICOLON •

    $default  reduce using rule 8 (statement)
